---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Future of Work">
	
	<section class="bg-dark text-white pt-16 pb-24 relative overflow-hidden">
		<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-2 h-full bg-brand opacity-80"></div>

		<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
			<div class="md:col-span-8">
				<span class="text-brand font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-4 block">
					Company Overview
				</span>
				<h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-serif font-black leading-tight mb-6">
					Membangun Masa Depan <br/>
					<span class="text-gray-400">Bisnis Digital.</span>
				</h1>
				<p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-300 font-light leading-relaxed border-l-4 border-brand pl-6">
					Kami membantu organisasi bertransformasi melalui teknologi, data, dan strategi manusia yang terukur untuk menghadapi tantangan global.
				</p>
			</div>
			
			<div class="hidden md:block md:col-span-4 relative">
				<div class="w-full h-full border border-gray-800 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center opacity-30">
					<span class="text-gray-600">Dynamic Abstract Visual</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 -mt-10 relative z-10">
		<div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
			
			<main class="md:col-span-8 bg-white p-0 md:pr-10">
				
				<div class="bg-accent p-8 mb-12 border-t-4 border-brand shadow-sm">
					<h3 class="font-bold text-lg uppercase tracking-wide mb-4 text-gray-500">Key Capabilities</h3>
					<ul class="space-y-3 font-medium text-gray-800">
						<li class="flex items-start">
							<span class="text-brand mr-2">■</span> Digital Transformation Strategy
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start">
							<span class="text-brand mr-2">■</span> AI & Workforce Automation
						</li>
						<li class="flex items-start">
							<span class="text-brand mr-2">■</span> Enterprise Cloud Architecture
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<article class="prose prose-lg prose-headings:font-serif prose-headings:font-bold prose-a:text-brand max-w-none text-gray-600">
					<h2>Visi Kami</h2>
					<p>
						Seperti halnya evolusi tenaga kerja yang dibahas oleh Deloitte, perusahaan kami percaya bahwa 
						teknologi bukan pengganti manusia, melainkan <em>multiplier</em>. Kami berdiri sejak 2020 
						dengan satu misi: menyederhanakan kompleksitas.
					</p>
					
					<h3>Pendekatan Strategis</h3>
					<p>
						Kami tidak hanya mengirimkan kode; kami mengirimkan solusi. Tim kami terdiri dari 
						para ahli yang memahami irisan antara kebutuhan bisnis dan kapabilitas teknis.
					</p>

					<blockquote>
						"Innovation distinguishes between a leader and a follower."
					</blockquote>

					<p>
						Dalam setiap proyek, kami menerapkan metodologi <strong>Agile</strong> yang ketat namun fleksibel, 
						memastikan setiap sprint memberikan nilai nyata bagi pemangku kepentingan Anda.
					</p>
				</article>
				
			</main>

			<aside class="md:col-span-4 space-y-8 mt-10 md:mt-0">
				
				<div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 p-6 shadow-sm sticky top-24">
					<h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">Leadership</h4>
					
					<div class="flex items-center space-x-4 mb-6">
						<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gray-300 rounded-full overflow-hidden shrink-0">
							<img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="CEO" class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all"/>
						</div>
						<div>
							<h5 class="font-bold text-gray-900 font-serif">Nama Anda</h5>
							<p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Principal Director</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="text-sm space-y-3 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
						<a href="#" class="flex items-center text-gray-600 hover:text-brand">
							<span class="mr-2">✉</span> email@anda.com
						</a>
						<a href="#" class="flex items-center text-gray-600 hover:text-brand">
							<span class="mr-2">in</span> LinkedIn Profile
						</a>
					</div>
					
					<div class="mt-8">
						<a href="#" class="block w-full py-3 bg-brand text-white font-bold text-center hover:bg-opacity-90 transition">
							Download Company Deck
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

			</aside>

		</div>
	</div>

</BaseLayout>